config BT_RFCOMM
	tristate "RFCOMM protocol support"
	depends on BT_BREDR
	help
	  RFCOMM provides connection oriented stream transport.  RFCOMM
	  support is required for Dialup Networking, OBEX and other Bluetooth
	  applications.
